\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Final habitat models (Tweedie GAMs) for each species and site. Predictors are anomalies from the 10-year climatology except FSLE, FSLV orientation and EKE. Term deviance explained is the decrease in deviance explained when the term is removed and the model refit, so terms need not sum to the model total. Shape describes the fitted smooth. ‡ Low-sample model (10--20 bins with detections; at most two terms). † Term not significant when residual autocorrelation was modeled with an AR(1) process, or when refit by maximum likelihood (Supplement S5). Bins were 4 days long (killer whales, 2 days).}}{15}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
