\newlabel{fig-ts}{{S1}{18}{Temperature--salinity diagrams for EI, KGI, and CI over each site's recording period. Each point is a daily box-mean (±20 km) value at one model level (0.5--1000 m) from the Copernicus Marine Service global physics reanalysis, colored by depth (square-root scale). Grey contours show potential density anomaly (\(\sigma _\theta \), kg m\(^{-3}\); labelled every 0.2 kg m\(^{-3}\)), and the dashed line shows the surface freezing temperature}{figure.caption.11}{}}
