\newlabel{tab:seaice}{{S2}{21}{Sea-ice models (presence ~ s(sea-ice concentration)) for each species and site, using all bins. Robust to AR(1): whether the effect remained significant when residual autocorrelation was modeled with an AR(1) process (significant effects only). ‡ Low-sample model (10--20 bins with detections)}{table.caption.20}{}}
